{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t10.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t10.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t10_orien_01_01",
      "hash64": "25E39EB0138CAF26",
      "text": "这里是翠绿镇，\\n大自然和苹果都很出名哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t10_orien_05_01",
      "hash64": "21F8B68CBD2F7E6A",
      "text": "听说你是从海外来参加夏令营的？\\n难怪我都没见过你呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t10_orien_07_01",
      "hash64": "4F266A9FA3168BC8",
      "text": "庆典准备得还算顺利吗？\\n要卖的东西迟迟出不了货呢……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t10_orien_08_01",
      "hash64": "1D815A75E9DD7DE3",
      "text": "我最近每天都在家\\n练习做炒面。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t10_orien_09_01",
      "hash64": "46B96E6A9F602D8E",
      "text": "桃泽商店很方便咧！\\n道具当然不用说了！\\c\\n连那家店的老奶奶自己织的\\n暖暖的袜子都会拿来卖哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t10_orien_11_01",
      "hash64": "397CD68925BE6D2D",
      "text": "从这前面上去就是北上中心了！\\n是个不算好走的山路，要加油咯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t10_orien_14_01",
      "hash64": "E76F12A4E10EE254",
      "text": "蚊香蝌蚪的肚子！\\n看着看着我就眼花缭乱啦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t10_orien_23_01",
      "hash64": "417D725FAC2A9B6E",
      "text": "丹瑜和乌栗\\n都到海外的学园就读了呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t10_orien_24_01",
      "hash64": "965A2A559CC188E5",
      "text": "那对爱惹事的姐弟，\\n听说他们回来了？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t10_orien_28_01",
      "hash64": "D061E2B97FAA71F9",
      "text": "田地里的水稻成熟后，\\n就有大米……有米饭吃了哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t10_orien_32_01",
      "hash64": "029C465479509FDC",
      "text": "把米饭夹在三明治里！？\\n在北上没听过这种吃法。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t10_orien_34_01",
      "hash64": "26408A20B10AA762",
      "text": "这座村子里啥也没有，对吧？\\n但就是这点才好呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_01_01",
      "hash64": "FAD7B0A01478F42E",
      "text": "这里是翠绿镇。\\n掩面祭很有名的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_05_01",
      "hash64": "9EB4A881A4A8A392",
      "text": "青年团体的各位都在炒热庆典的氛围，\\n所以你就好好享受吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_05_02",
      "hash64": "9EB4A781A4A8A1DF",
      "text": "我在北上中心\\n看到宝伴了！！\\r\\n它们吃了好多北上粘糕！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_05_03",
      "hash64": "9EB4A681A4A8A02C",
      "text": "我听说有个小孩\\n跟厄诡椪关系很好！\\r\\n……难不成是乌栗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_07_01",
      "hash64": "22675C8FA29105F0",
      "text": "我喜欢够赞狗！\\n它那绿色的部分实在太棒了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_07_02",
      "hash64": "22675F8FA2910B09",
      "text": "够赞狗的本尊！\\n它没有面具那么绿哦！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_07_03",
      "hash64": "22675E8FA2910956",
      "text": "厄诡椪本尊和\\n它的面具都是绿色的，太棒啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_11_01",
      "hash64": "B77F487E0E4D2E75",
      "text": "糖水果摊的糖苹果啊！\\c\\n那是用在苹果之丘现摘的\\n整颗苹果做出来的哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_15_01",
      "hash64": "917810A02B06E331",
      "text": "“掩面”包含面具的意思，\\n所以这才会是个戴面具的庆典吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_t10_zombie_npc_01",
      "hash64": "1D998FA71A46F924",
      "text": "咭呗咭呗！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_t10_zombie_npc_03",
      "hash64": "1D9991A71A46FC8A",
      "text": "咭、咭呗、咭、咭呗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_t10_zombie_npc_05",
      "hash64": "1D998BA71A46F258",
      "text": "咭呗、咭呗……\\n咭……呗……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
